{"assets":["/statement-assets/6c0cbe22cf10a8a1d3d81094e27355dd17b47aa2541eae804c5f95951615533a.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1287","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Hyperset"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Bees Alice and Alesya gave beekeeper Polina famous card game \"Set\" as a Christmas present. The deck consists of cards that vary in four features across three options for each kind of feature: number of shapes, shape, shading, and color. In this game, some combinations of three cards are said to make up a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"set"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". For every feature — color, number, shape, and shading — the three cards must display that feature as either all the same, or pairwise different. The picture below shows how sets look."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/6c0cbe22cf10a8a1d3d81094e27355dd17b47aa2541eae804c5f95951615533a.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polina came up with a new game called \"Hyperset\". In her game, there are $$$n$$$ cards with $$$k$$$ features, each feature has three possible values: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"S"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". The original \"Set\" game can be viewed as \"Hyperset\" with $$$k = 4$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Similarly to the original game, three cards form a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"set"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", if all features are the same for all cards or are pairwise different. The goal of the game is to compute the number of ways to choose three cards that form a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"set"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Unfortunately, winter holidays have come to an end, and it's time for Polina to go to school. Help Polina find the number of sets among the cards lying on the table."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 1500$$$, $$$1 \\le k \\le 30$$$) — number of cards and number of features."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the following $$$n$$$ lines contains a card description: a string consisting of $$$k$$$ letters \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"S"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". The $$$i$$$-th character of this string decribes the $$$i$$$-th feature of that card. All cards are distinct."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer — the number of ways to choose three cards that form a set."}